{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev40121","label":"COIN RUSH SHOWDOWN · Part 1"},"label":"The Manufacturers' Expo","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"event_coinrushshowdown1_01_s","speakers":{"ingrid":"Ingrid","syuen":"Syuen","mustang":"Mustang"},"icons":{"ingrid":"si_c900_00_s","syuen":"si_c901_00_s","mustang":"si_c902_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_1","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_1","text":"Inside Mustang's office...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Office","bgArt":"office","image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":["syuen","ingrid","mustang"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_2","text":"A manufacturers' expo?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"event_bgm_neverland_schedulecheck_day","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_3","text":"What the heck is that?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_4","text":"Oui, oui! C'est un manufacturers' expo for the Big Three that keep the Ark running.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_5","text":"We'll be showing products equipped with the latest technologie from the Big Three, and letting the citizens have the full expérience firsthand, bien sûr!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_6","text":"This will be a bonne opportunité to share la vision of le company!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_7","text":"Well, this is rather sudden.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_8","text":"Right? So you want us to show everyone that the Big Three are best friends now?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_9","text":"Did you forget we're competitors?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_10","text":"I don't have time to prepare for something like that. I'm better off spending my time refining my tactics.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_11","text":"Again with that tactical nonsense. How are you even supposed to refine something like that in the first place?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_12","text":"What would you people at Missiles know anyway? You're always holed up in your offices, hammering away at your keyboards.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_13","text":"Hey! I told you to stop calling us \"Missiles!\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_14","text":"D'accord. Let me give you les détails.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_15","text":"Un petit moment ago, a higher-up from the Central Government paid me a visit.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_16","text":"They proposé holding la Big Three manufacturers' expo at Coin Rush.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_17","text":"The purpose est très simple.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_18","text":"That is, to showcase la technologie and la vision of the Big Three to the citizens of the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_19","text":"And, to rassurer them that the Ark is still safe.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_20","text":"Plus, I want the Big Three to présenter together to le public how the Ark's technologie is advancing every day.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_21","text":"Hmm...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_22","text":"That's unnecessary. If that's what's needed, Missilis would be better off holding our own expo.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_23","text":"Mon Dieu. You're not seeing la bigger picture.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_24","text":"Excuse me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_25","text":"It's all about comparison.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_26","text":"Displaying the Big Three's latest technologies and visions side by side will naturally invite comparison.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_27","text":"\"Huh... Missiles isn't as impressive as Tetra. What? Missiles can't even hold a candle to Elysion.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_28","text":"\"Missiles is the lamest out of the Big Three.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_29","text":"That's exactly what will happen.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_30","text":"Hey! You sure are quick to place Missilis dead last, huh?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_31","text":"Well? Am I wrong?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_32","text":"Ugh! You're seriously getting on my nerves.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_33","text":"In other words, this will be the stage where we prove to the citizens of the Ark which manufacturer stands above the rest.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_34","text":"Oui! Exactement!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_35","text":"... But that's not all, is it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_36","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_37","text":"Being all quiet doesn't suit you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_38","text":"I knew it! This is gonna determine which company the Central Government officially recognizes as the best, isn't it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_39","text":"I thought that's what this was all about. Are we right, Mustang? I guess you didn't become CEO on account of your personality, after all.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_40","text":"Haha. I guess there's no fooling you two.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_41","text":"C'est vrai. The ultimate objective of the manufacturers' expo is to déterminer the best of the Big Three.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_42","text":"The winner will receive the Central Government's officiel backing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_43","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_44","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_45","text":"The Big Three already have une très, très grande influence on their own,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_46","text":"but with the Central Government as your wings... Oh là là, c'est unimaginable.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_47","text":"You could become the talk of the Ark, littéralement.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_48","text":"You would ascend to the very pinnacle of the Ark, accomplishing what even your prédécesseurs never could.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_49","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_50","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_51","text":"I see no reason not to participate.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_prologue_52","text":"Duh.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"af